id           = CWE-393
name         = Return of Wrong Status Code
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Draft

description : A function or operation returns an incorrect return value or status code that does not indicate the true result of execution, causing the product to modify its behavior based on the incorrect result.

extended description : This can lead to unpredictable behavior. If the function is used to make security-critical decisions or provide security-critical information, then the wrong status code can cause the product to assume that an action is safe or correct, even when it is not.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/393.html
